# The reference manual is read online - every algorithm's Help button and the
# metadata homepage both open DOC_BASE_URL
# (https://geophilo.com/planx_geostats/manual.html), and no
# code path opens a local copy. Shipping it put the same 1.2 MB file in the zip
# twice, once at the root and once under docs/. Same convention as planx, which
# already ignores docs/.
docs
GEOSTATS_REFERENCE_MANUAL.html

# Repository-only content, not part of the installed plugin.
# The CI workflows are not read by anything the plugin runs.
.github

